WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.416
Hi, I'm Lenny Henry, and we're playing
quickfire questions.

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:08.125
What name would I give to my weapon?

00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:08.666
Erm...

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:14.541
Michu and Bony,  who are the two most
famous players to play for Swansea City.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.000
The only name is coming to
my mind is Vivian.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:20.166
I don't know...
I don’t think I would call it that.

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:22.154
Jeff the Bat

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:24.557
Kardashians have named one of their dogs Sushi.

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:25.541
And I love sushi.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:27.166
And I thought it was a really cool
name for a dog.

00:00:27.166 --> 00:00:29.750
So... Sushi?

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:32.125
Ooh, I think we did give it a name.

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:36.469
I think they're referring to my Staff of Knowledge, which is beautiful and...

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.320
Erm... I can’t remember what it’s bloody called!

00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:39.666
We called it The Answer.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.791
I don't think I would be at liberty
to make that decision without conferring

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:47.166
with my celestial twin
and partner in crime, Syndril.

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:50.458
Syndril has... a shared magic

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:54.166
with Zacaré, 
so I have to confer with her.

00:00:55.541 --> 00:00:56.666
If I could

00:00:56.666 --> 00:01:00.708
pick a creature to represent my clan,
I would pick koalas.

00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:03.291
So I've been told because of my bald head

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:06.958
and my laid back nature,
I sometimes resemble a turtle.

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:10.570
So I would go with a turtle coming
out of the shell.

00:01:11.653 --> 00:01:12.472
Whippet! 

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.282
I would make it Penguin Clan.

00:01:14.282 --> 00:01:15.067
Penguins.

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:18.333
Which doesn't sound as formidable as Dog,

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:20.180
Serpent and Raven.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.916
Just waddling about on the Continent.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.701
Just... Just being adorable.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:25.652
I love penguins.

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:27.000
My heart’s kinda set on Dog Clan.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.583
I have to be have to be loyal to the guys, y’know?

00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:31.083
Which song snaps me out of beast mode?

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.750
A Case of You by Joni Mitchell.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.333
I’d just get really sad.

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:36.833
We built this city.

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:39.583
We built this city in Xin’trea.

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.034
We built this city!

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.069
Wannabe by the Spice Girls.

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:46.041
Because at the first, like the opening,
I thought I would really like

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:47.540
that would snap you out, for sure.

00:01:47.665 --> 00:01:48.341
Spice Girls.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.277
 I wanna make you holler, holler!

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:54.833
That's your old school
Scrap that. Kendrick Lamar's...

00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:56.500
We gon' be alright

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:58.125
We gon' be alright.

00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:00.083
Be humble. Sit down.

00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:02.458
Be humble.

00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:05.416
I don't think we should say that.
Sit down.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.125
Yeah, sorry.

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:09.958
I think I would feel pretty...

00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:11.000
Pretty safe

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.898
with Zacaré.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:14.734
Scían, played by Michelle Yeoh.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.301
Fierce.

00:02:15.843 --> 00:02:18.304
Meldof is a force to be reckoned with.

00:02:18.666 --> 00:02:22.291
I would like Meldof. just because
I think we'd have a right f**cking laugh.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.666
Michelle Yeoh.

00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:26.000
I would like to defend me in all battles.

00:02:27.166 --> 00:02:30.041
The Lark can kill 15 blokes
while she's sipping a pint

00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:31.750
and doing needlework at the same time.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.166
You don't mess with The Lark.

00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:35.125
- We are not dying here.

00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:38.750
If I could travel anywhere
with the powers of a monolith,

00:02:39.083 --> 00:02:42.125
I would most likely
just consistently be my bed.

00:02:43.583 --> 00:02:45.265
Oh, there's so many places...

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.366
Dudley!

00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:49.000
Dudley in the West Midlands,
near Dudley Zoo. We've got a canal.

00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:50.208
Come on, get a monolith

00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:51.571
up there in the town center.

00:02:52.154 --> 00:02:53.640
Somewhere under the ocean.

00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:55.375
And there's a breathing problem.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.625
I think I'd probably travel to Iceland,
where some of our beautiful show was shot.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.625
I'd probably go back and look at the
dinosaurs, see what's going on.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:06.458
If I got to trade weapons
with another member of The Seven,

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:08.291
it would be a tie between...

00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:13.375
Soulreaver and Brother Death’s cleavers.
Just to wind up Brother Death, really.

00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:16.333
They just look so,
like, so terrifying and impressive.

00:03:16.333 --> 00:03:19.125
So, yeah,
I think cleaver in each hand be great.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.791
I'm going to go with Meldof and Gwen

00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:21.500
I just think

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.291
it's the coolest hammer in the world,
but obviously not as good as the cleavers.

00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:27.000
But I have to choose one.
So, yeah.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.125
Sofia Brown
has these gorgeous little daggers

00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:33.750
and you'll see the way she moves them...
It’s effortless.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:37.250
And I think there's something quite free
about that. I think would be quite cool.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.250
Now, you can’t tell her this, right?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.291
But I probably would get the two blades.

00:03:41.458 --> 00:03:46.583
I think I want that big, stabby axe thing
that Fjall’s got

00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:49.250
because that would be a very good
thing for cutting pies into quarters.

00:03:49.416 --> 00:03:53.375
Brother Death’s cleavers.
‘Cause I don’t have a lot of finesse.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.750
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

